        "mental",
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The sporeback frog shakes the plants and fungi on its back until they emit a cloud of spores in a 20ft Emanation. All creatures in the area must succeed a DC 22 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Clumsy 2 and Stupefied 2 for 1 minute (Clumsy 3 and Stupefied 3 on a critical failure). This ability can't be used again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
